{"repo_path": "platform/frameworks/base", "commit_hash": "40c30bb5613ee94403723b37d0d6c58197d3d1b4", "author_name": "Evan Rosky", "author_email": "erosky@google.com", "commit_time": "Thu Sep 11 15:23:52 2025 -0700", "commit_message": "Map animation delegate to the transition instead of plumbing it\n\nPreviously we were plumbing the animation delegate into WM and\nthen back-out through Request and then back-in again when we\nactually wanted to boost the thread priority.\n\nInstead of doing that, record the delegate in WM and then shell\nonly has to notify when to boost. This prevents mismatches, is\nmore robust to situations where we don't have a handleRequest,\nand removes the need to send an IApplicationThread token out\nof WMCore.\n\nBug: 438742644\nTest: atest ActivityManagerTest#testActivityManager_stripsAppThreadFromRemoteTransition\nFlag: EXEMPT CVE_FIX\nDISABLE_TOPIC_PROTECTOR\n(cherry picked from commit a35ab54ec741fb24370ef543d79d44d07823a292)\nCherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:19b5974515cfb4454beb0cd8b3e8e1cbe59bdcfa\nMerged-In: Ie7d28d52fe37177ad10f8969b9d8cc6594cbc41c\nChange-Id: Ie7d28d52fe37177ad10f8969b9d8cc6594cbc41c", "changed_files": [{"type": "modify", "old_path": "core/java/android/app/IActivityTaskManager.aidl", "new_path": "core/java/android/app/IActivityTaskManager.aidl"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "core/java/android/window/WindowContainerTransaction.java", "new_path": "core/java/android/window/WindowContainerTransaction.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/recents/RecentsTransitionHandler.java", "new_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/recents/RecentsTransitionHandler.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/splitscreen/SplitScreenTransitions.java", "new_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/splitscreen/SplitScreenTransitions.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/OneShotRemoteHandler.java", "new_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/OneShotRemoteHandler.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/RemoteTransitionHandler.java", "new_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/RemoteTransitionHandler.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/Transitions.java", "new_path": "libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/Transitions.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/ActivityTaskManagerService.java", "new_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/ActivityTaskManagerService.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/Transition.java", "new_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/Transition.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/TransitionController.java", "new_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/TransitionController.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/WindowOrganizerController.java", "new_path": "services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/WindowOrganizerController.java"}]}